{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2015-03", "window": 3, "start_date": 1426464000, "end_date": 1427155199, "month_true_total": 172, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:09:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "15026061", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071765662", "personaname": "violet?????????????", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pandathee/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 3694, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 254, "last_played": 1570239940, "avatar": "69965062c6913f6c51e6dc3631217941f1ff128c"}, "language": "english", "review": "An all around good game, very hard and full of lots of things that want to kill you. A good rogue-like game for hardcore gamers. 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1427147750, "timestamp_updated": 1427147750, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15020866", "author": {"steamid": "76561198109436972", "personaname": "FisherCS", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fishercs/", "num_games_owned": 1084, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 3017, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1328, "last_played": 1775959097, "avatar": "d8c36f4dc9be1e95c8a228d9beabe1a937957c20"}, "language": "english", "review": "[b] Description [/b]\n\nRisk of Rain is an action platformer/adventure game with randomized elements. The game is set in the distant future, where space transportation is common. Space trains carry passengers and goods all across space. A particular space train, however, had some very special cargo. Through a series of unfortunate events, this space train gets shot out of orbit and crash lands on a mysterious planet.. with one survivor.\n\n[b] Review [/b]\n\nEnjoyable game with high replayability and unfair difficulty.\n\n[+] Pros\n- Fresh gameplay\n- Randomized encounter\n- Permadeath\n- Twelve characters with his/her/its own tactic and playstyle\n- Three difficulties to play\na. Drizzle (Not even casual)\nb. Rainstorm (Don't be panic, dude)\nc. Monsoon (Motherfather anchestor of Dark Souls)\n- Increasing difficulty after the game starts\n- Online and Local Co-Op\n- Simple but cool art and music\n\n[-] Cons\n- Bit buggy\n- Frame drops\n\nFrustating, but really fun.", "timestamp_created": 1427122848, "timestamp_updated": 1427122848, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.569285452365875244", "comment_count": 5, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15018675", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084831532", "personaname": "Grim", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Grimagain/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2093, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1784, "last_played": 1568865575, "avatar": "48710bff01327c131c80e533c98a337afd3b8fb7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game to play with friends, and to also play alone. Loads of options making the game extremely replayable.", "timestamp_created": 1427109073, "timestamp_updated": 1427109073, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.544773995876312256", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15015945", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114290701", "personaname": "Jayem"